{
  "id": "dmw7kee2gwc5e",
  "name": "拖拽放置",
  "tags": [
    "拖拽",
    "交互"
  ],
  "summary": "按住卡片拖动，拖到目标区域上方时高亮、松手放下；拖到无效区域则回弹归位。",
  "usage": "把文件/卡片归档到某个分组、把任务拖进某个状态列；目标区域明确、拖动距离短（一屏内）。",
  "caution": "回弹后会回到原位、可以继续拖；已放置的卡片点一下即可取消，不需要额外的重置入口。需要排序用可排序列表；列表超过 20 项改用「选择 + 移动」。",
  "hint": "拖到虚线框里放下，点已放置的卡片取消",
  "prompt": "【拖拽放置】目标：按住一张卡片拖动，拖到目标槽位上方时槽位高亮；松手时若卡片中心在槽位内，卡片吸附进槽位；不在就回弹。**单击已放置的卡片即可取消放置**——不需要额外的「重置」按钮。\n\n1) 结构：.board（flex 横排）里放 .src（可拖卡片）+ .slot（目标槽位）。**槽位与卡片必须同宽同高**，才有「放进去刚刚好」的观感。\n\n2) 拖动用 **transform 位移**，不要让卡片 `position:absolute` 脱离文档流——一旦脱离，槽位会在 flex 里前移一格，落点判定直接错位。\n\n3) 事件：pointerdown 记录起点与卡片初始 rect，setPointerCapture；pointermove 设 `translate(dx,dy)`；pointerup 判定落点（卡片中心是否在槽位内）。\n\n4) **取消放置 = 单击已放置的卡片**：pointerup 时若 `!moved && src.classList.contains('archived')`，直接 `cancelArchive()`（移除归档态、清 transform、恢复槽位）。不要额外加「重置」按钮——演示动画里更不该出现操作按钮，界面自己应该能回到初始态。\n\n5) **拖动与取消的分工**：pointerdown 时**不要**立刻重置归档态；等 pointermove 超过 4px 判为拖动时，才解除归档、以当前位置为新基准继续拖。否则一按下卡片就跳回原位，手感很怪。\n\n6) 回弹动画：`el.animate(...)` **不要加 `fill:'forwards'`**，onfinish 里 `anim.cancel()` + 清 transform，否则动画残留会锁住 transform，之后拖不动。\n\n7) 视觉：拖拽中卡片阴影加深；槽位在卡片中心进入时虚线变实线、品牌色；放下后卡片绿色边框、槽位隐藏。\n\n8) 无障碍：卡片 tabindex=\"0\" + role=\"button\"；已放置时 `aria-pressed=\"true\"` 或改 label 为「点击取消放置」；键盘 Space 切换。\n\n9) 配色：虚线 var(--ui-border)，高亮 var(--ui-brand)，归档成功 var(--ui-success)。\n\n10) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（拖到槽位 → 吸附 → 停 1.4 秒 → 单击卡片取消 → 复位）；演示光标逐帧跟随（临时关掉过渡）。\n\n11) 使用场景：归档、任务拖进状态列；需要排序用可排序列表；列表超过 20 项改用「选择 + 移动」。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:22px}\n\n.board{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}\n\n/* 卡片与槽位同尺寸：放进去「刚刚好」 */\n.src{width:104px;height:96px;flex:0 0 auto;padding:9px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  box-shadow:0 6px 18px color-mix(in srgb,#000 10%,transparent);cursor:grab;user-select:none;touch-action:none;\n  transition:box-shadow .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n.src:active{cursor:grabbing}\n/* 拖动只用 transform，不脱离文档流——否则槽位会在 flex 里前移，落点判定错位 */\n.src.dragging{z-index:5;pointer-events:none;box-shadow:0 16px 36px color-mix(in srgb,#000 22%,transparent);transition:none}\n.src .thumb{height:40px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:7px;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 55%,transparent),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 18%,transparent))}\n.src b{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.src small{display:block;margin-top:1px;font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.src.archived{border-color:var(--ui-success);cursor:pointer}\n.src.archived .thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 22%,transparent)}\n.src.archived b{color:var(--ui-success)}\n\n/* 槽位：与卡片完全同宽同高，虚线只是「这里空着」的示意 */\n.slot{width:104px;height:96px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px dashed var(--ui-border);\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  transition:border-color .18s ease,background .18s ease,color .18s ease}\n.slot.over{border-color:var(--ui-brand);border-style:solid;color:var(--ui-brand);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 8%,transparent)}\n.slot.done{border-color:var(--ui-success);border-style:solid;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 8%,transparent);color:var(--ui-success);visibility:hidden}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px}\n  .board{gap:12px}\n  .src,.slot{width:88px;height:82px}\n  .src{padding:7px;border-radius:10px}\n  .src .thumb{height:32px;margin-bottom:5px}\n  .src b{font-size:10px}\n  .src small{font-size:9px}\n  .slot{font-size:9px;border-radius:10px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .src,.slot{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"board\" id=\"board\">\n  <div class=\"src\" id=\"src\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"设计稿 v2，可拖动\">\n    <div class=\"thumb\"></div>\n    <b>设计稿 v2</b>\n    <small>1.2 MB</small>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"slot\" id=\"slot\"><span id=\"slotText\">放到这里</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var board = document.getElementById('board'),\n      src = document.getElementById('src'),\n      slot = document.getElementById('slot'),\n      slotText = document.getElementById('slotText');\n\n  var startX = 0, startY = 0, baseRect = null;\n  var dragging = false, moved = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function clearAnim(){\n    src.getAnimations().forEach(function(a){ a.cancel(); });\n    src.style.transform = '';\n  }\n\n  function restoreSlot(){\n    slot.classList.remove('over', 'done');\n    slot.style.visibility = '';\n    slotText.textContent = '放到这里';\n  }\n\n  function cancelArchive(){\n    src.classList.remove('archived');\n    clearAnim();\n    restoreSlot();\n  }\n\n  function reset(){\n    clearAnim();\n    src.classList.remove('dragging', 'archived');\n    restoreSlot();\n  }\n\n  function rectOf(el){ return el.getBoundingClientRect(); }\n\n  function centerIn(cardRect, targetRect){\n    var cx = cardRect.left + cardRect.width / 2;\n    var cy = cardRect.top + cardRect.height / 2;\n    return cx >= targetRect.left && cx <= targetRect.right &&\n           cy >= targetRect.top && cy <= targetRect.bottom;\n  }\n\n  function onDown(e){\n    if(dragging) return;\n    clearAnim();\n    baseRect = rectOf(src);\n    startX = e.clientX;\n    startY = e.clientY;\n    dragging = true;\n    moved = false;\n    src.classList.add('dragging');\n    if(e.pointerId != null && src.setPointerCapture){\n      try { src.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err){}\n    }\n  }\n\n  function onMove(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    var dx = e.clientX - startX;\n    var dy = e.clientY - startY;\n    if(!moved && (Math.abs(dx) > 4 || Math.abs(dy) > 4)){\n      moved = true;\n      /* 真正开始拖动时才解除归档，以新位置为基准继续拖 */\n      if(src.classList.contains('archived')){\n        src.classList.remove('archived');\n        clearAnim();\n        restoreSlot();\n        baseRect = rectOf(src);\n        startX = e.clientX;\n        startY = e.clientY;\n        return;\n      }\n    }\n    src.style.transform = 'translate(' + dx + 'px,' + dy + 'px)';\n    slot.classList.toggle('over', centerIn(rectOf(src), rectOf(slot)));\n  }\n\n  function onUp(){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    dragging = false;\n    src.classList.remove('dragging');\n\n    /* 单击已放置的卡片 = 取消放置（不需要额外的重置按钮） */\n    if(!moved && src.classList.contains('archived')){\n      cancelArchive();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var inZone = centerIn(rectOf(src), rectOf(slot));\n\n    if(inZone){\n      var slotRect = rectOf(slot);\n      src.style.transform = 'translate(' + (slotRect.left - baseRect.left) + 'px,' + (slotRect.top - baseRect.top) + 'px)';\n      src.classList.add('archived');\n      slot.classList.remove('over');\n      slot.classList.add('done');\n      slotText.textContent = '已归档';\n    } else if(moved){\n      var r = rectOf(src);\n      var anim = src.animate([\n        { transform: 'translate(' + (r.left - baseRect.left) + 'px,' + (r.top - baseRect.top) + 'px)' },\n        { transform: 'translate(0,0)' }\n      ], { duration: 280, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.34,1.4,.64,1)' });\n      anim.onfinish = function(){\n        anim.cancel();\n        src.style.transform = '';\n      };\n      slot.classList.remove('over');\n    }\n  }\n\n  src.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n  src.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n  src.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n  src.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    reset();\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    var cardRect = rectOf(src);\n    var slotRect = rectOf(slot);\n    var startCX = cardRect.left + cardRect.width / 2;\n    var startCY = cardRect.top + cardRect.height / 2;\n    var endCX = slotRect.left + slotRect.width / 2;\n    var endCY = slotRect.top + slotRect.height / 2;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(src);\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      src.setPointerCapture = function(){};\n      onDown({ clientX: startCX, clientY: startCY });\n\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      var dur = 900;\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = t < .5 ? 2 * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 2) / 2;\n        var x = startCX + (endCX - startCX) * e;\n        var y = startCY + (endCY - startCY) * e;\n        onMove({ clientX: x, clientY: y });\n        c.el.style.transition = 'none';\n        c.el.style.left = x + 'px';\n        c.el.style.top = y + 'px';\n        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\n        else {\n          c.el.style.transition = '';\n          c.release();\n          onUp();\n          /* 再演示一次「单击已放置卡片取消」 */\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            var arch = rectOf(src);\n            var cx = arch.left + arch.width / 2;\n            var cy = arch.top + arch.height / 2;\n            c.el.classList.add('show');\n            c.el.style.transition = 'none';\n            c.el.style.left = cx + 'px';\n            c.el.style.top = cy + 'px';\n            setTimeout(function(){\n              c.press();\n              onDown({ clientX: cx, clientY: cy });\n              setTimeout(function(){\n                c.release();\n                onUp();\n                if(c.hide) c.hide();\n              }, 170);\n            }, 300);\n          }, 1400);\n        }\n      }\n      requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 5200); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  reset();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
